==About==
===Format===
* '''Group Stage:''' July ''16<sup>th</sup>'' - August ''9<sup>th</sup>'', 2026
** Two Single-Round Robin Groups
*** Each Group has 6 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} from each group advance to ''Playoffs''
*** {{Bgcolortext|seedup|Winners}} have a bye into the ''Upper Bracket Semifinals''
*** {{Bgcolortext|up|2<sup>nd</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Upper Bracket Round 1''
*** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|3<sup>rd</sup> & 4<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-In Upper Bracket Round 2''
*** {{Bgcolortext|stay|5<sup>th</sup> & 6<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} advance to ''Play-In Upper Bracket Round 1''
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for detailed information about Group Stage Draw''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Kickoff-Drawshow" style="margin-top:10px;" style="margin-left:45px;">
* 12 Teams are divided into 6 seeds as per their final standings in [[VCT/2026/Americas League/Stage 1|Stage 1 2026]].
* 2 seeds are grouped into a single pool, 3 pools are formed.
* A representative draw slip (Slips with #1, #2 etc. written) will be placed into three pools.
* Each Pool will select a single draw slip.
* The chosen seed in the slip will swap groups for Stage 2 as follows:
** '''Pool 1''' consists of top two teams from the Stage 1: 
*** '''#1 Seeds: {{Team|G2 Esports}} & {{Team|NRG}}
*** '''#2 Seeds: {{Team|Leviatán}} & {{Team|100 Thieves}}
** '''Pool 2''' consists of the 3rd & 4th teams the Stage 1: 
*** '''#3 Seeds: {{Team|MIBR}} & {{Team|KRÜ Esports}}
*** '''#4 Seeds: {{Team|LOUD}} & {{Team|FURIA}} 
** '''Pool 3''' consists of the 5th & 6th teams the Stage 1: 
*** '''#5 Seeds: {{Team|ENVY}} & {{Team|Sentinels}}
*** '''#6 Seeds: {{Team|Cloud9}} & {{Team|Evil Geniuses}}
</div></div>
** <span class="mw-customtoggle-Tiebreaker" style="border-bottom:1px dotted;">''Click here for tiebreaker rules''</span>
<div class="table-responsive">
<div class="toccolours mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" id="mw-customcollapsible-Tiebreaker" style="margin-left:45px">
*'''Tiebreaker rules:'''
*#Head-to-head Match Score
*#Head-to-head Map Differential
*#Head-to-head Round Differential
*#Map Differential
*#Round Differential
* The following "Subgroup Tie-breaker Rule" will be applied for 3+ Team tie-breakers:
** If any Team(s) can be clearly ranked highest based on the given criterion (e.g., head-to-head match score), all teams will be split into two subgroups: the top Team(s) and the remaining Team(s). The remaining Teams are treated as one group, even if they are no longer tied under that criterion.
** A new tiebreaker is then applied from the beginning, based on the number of Teams in each subgroup.
*** '''Example:''' In a 4-way tie, if two Teams can be clearly ranked highest using the given criterion, the four Teams will be split into two 2-Team subgroups. Each subgroup will then follow the 2-way tiebreaker process, starting from (1) Head-to-head Match Score.
** The next tie-breaker criterion (e.g., (2), (3), etc.) is used only when no subgrouping can be made based on the current step.
** This process is repeated until all Teams are fully ranked
</div></div>

* '''Play-Ins:''' August ''13<sup>th</sup>'' - ''23<sup>rd</sup>'', 2026
** 12-team Double-Elimination bracket
*** 8 teams from [[VCT/2025/Americas League/Stage 2/Group Stage|Group Stage]]
*** 4 teams from '''Regional Challengers'''
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} advances to ''Upper Bracket Round 1''
** {{Bgcolortext|stayup|3<sup>rd</sup> & 4<sup>th</sup> placed teams}} start from ''Lower Bracket Round 1''

* '''Playoffs:''' August ''27<sup>th</sup>'' - September ''6<sup>th</sup>'', 2026
** Double-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Lower Bracket Final & Grand Final are {{Abbr/Bo5}}
** {{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} qualify for '''[[VCT/2026/Champions|Champions]]'''

